# The battery: every manifest exemplar, at full speed.
#
# Headless this is a gate — `chell -c 'play …/battery.mise …'` exits non-zero
# the moment a claim does not hold. At a surface, played with `--pace 2s`,
# it is the same file as a demonstration.
@name         manifest battery
@description  Play every manifest exemplar in order.
@param        SERIES
@param        FLOWS = exemplars/flows

play ${FLOWS}/00_session.mise
play ${FLOWS}/10_anonymize_nii.mise --param SERIES=${SERIES}
